The '''Vinyl Collector''' is an [[NPC]] that only appears in {{zone|The Garden}} as a {{Rare}} [[Visitor]]. They will only appear while {{NPCSprite|Finnegan}}'s Blooming Business Perk is active. They request a random [[Pest Vinyl]] from the player. Completing their offer will reward the player with a total of {{Item|Fine Flour|amount=18}}.

